{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14109040","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14109040","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1410904001:0":{"text":"看你之前说的话，一套又一套！什么至柔的恩惠女王的赐福，多喝两口少喝两口就要人命——","source_cn":"看你之前说的话，一套又一套！什么至柔的恩惠女王的赐福，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C35F7CE40704F2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410904002:0":{"text":"怎么现在只是当洗澡水用？这不堕落啊？这不亵渎啊？","source_cn":"怎么现在只是当洗澡水用？这不堕落啊？这不亵渎啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F1C61001258D777","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410904003:0":{"text":"灵露是恩典，享用恩典的方式有许多种。","source_cn":"灵露是恩典，享用恩典的方式有许多种。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x831755912E675224","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410904004:0":{"text":"我的内心始终虔诚而感恩，这份恩赐如此温柔地拥抱着我，让我仿佛回归母体的怀抱。","source_cn":"我的内心始终虔诚而感恩，这份恩赐如此温柔地拥抱着我，让...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB92A6987E598A22E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1410904004":{"text":"我的内心始终虔诚而感恩，这份恩赐如此温柔地拥抱着我，让我仿佛回归母体的怀抱。","source_cn":"我的内心始终虔诚而感恩，这份恩赐如此温柔地拥抱着我，让我仿佛回归母体的怀抱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB92A6987E598A22E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","documen